      {
        "text": "Scott R. Britton represents the 14th District on the Cook County Board of Commissioners and was sworn in in 2018. His campaign says he passed legislation providing renters' rights to over 245,000 suburban families, raising the smoking age to 21, and expanding ballot languages to 14. He chairs the Finance Subcommittee on Litigation and the Legislation and Intergovernmental Relations Committee. He is a founding partner of Ford & Britton PC and has practiced as a trial attorney since 1985. He previously served as a Glenview trustee and on the Glenview District 34 Board of Education.",
